# REQ-001: Conversational Q&A Chat Widget
**Priority:** Must Have
**Effort:** High
**Risk:** High
**Depends On:** None
---
## User Story
As an authenticated EMIS-X partner developer,
I need a conversational chat bot embedded in the partner portal,
So that I can get clear, example-driven answers to my interoperability questions without waiting for the internal team.
**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Widget is visible in the bottom-right corner on every portal page
- [ ] Both the widget and full-page view require EMIS-X authentication — unauthenticated users are redirected to login
- [ ] Bot reformulates documentation content in clearer language with examples rather than quoting verbatim
- [ ] Every answer includes a citation: the source page URL and the relevant quoted lines from that page
- [ ] Out-of-scope questions (e.g. "What's the weather like today?") receive a polite deflection: "I can only help with questions about EMIS interoperability — please try asking about our APIs or authentication flows."
- [ ] Conversation history persists across page navigation until the browser is closed or the user explicitly presses "Clear conversation"
