## Dimension 2: Information Governance
### Applicable Guardrails
- **IG-001:** Data Minimisation — only the user's question text and session conversation history are processed; no unnecessary personal data collected.
- **IG-003:** Lawful Basis Declaration — lawful basis for processing conversation data must be confirmed before go-live.
### GDPR Articles
- **Article 6 Lawful Basis:** `[UNVERIFIED — IG-OWNER: TBD — RESOLUTION DATE: TBD — GO-LIVE BLOCKER]`
  - Likely basis: Legitimate interests (Article 6(1)(f)) — processing partner developer queries to provide technical support. Requires confirmation.
- **Article 9 Special Category:** Not applicable — no health or special category data processed.
### Data Handling Requirements
- **Data Categories:** Conversation text (questions and answers), session state
- **Data Subjects:** External partner developers
- **Retention Period:** Session-scoped only — conversation history cleared on browser close or explicit reset. No server-side retention of conversation content unless escalation is triggered.
- **Data Minimisation:** Only collect question text; do not collect user identity, IP address, or device fingerprint unless required for escalation.
