## Dimension 3: Security
### Applicable Guardrails
- **AUTH-004:** Authorisation Required — EMIS-X authentication required for all access to the chat widget and full-page view.
- **SEC-001:** TLS Encryption in Transit — all communication between the widget and backend must use TLS 1.2+.
- **WSEC-006a:** URL Encoding — any user-supplied query text embedded in API requests must use `encodeURIComponent()`.
- **WSEC-013:** Security Headers — `@emisgroup/acp-security-headers` must be present in package dependencies.
### Security Requirements
- **Authentication:** EMIS-X OAuth2 — unauthenticated users redirected to EMIS-X login before chat is accessible.
- **Authorisation:** Authenticated EMIS-X users only.
- **Encryption in Transit:** TLS 1.2+ for all HTTP communication between widget and backend AI service.
- **Encryption at Rest:** Not applicable — no server-side conversation storage for standard interactions.
