## Dimension 4: Observability & Performance
### Product KPIs
- **KPI 1:** Bot answer rate (questions answered vs. deflected/escalated) — Baseline: 0%, Target: >80% answered without escalation
- **KPI 2:** Sprint time spent answering interop questions — Baseline: ~20%, Target: <5%
- **KPI 3:** p95 response latency — Baseline: N/A, Target: <10,000ms
### Observable Events (OTEL Instrumentation)
- **Span 1:** `qabot.chat.query.start`
  - Attributes: session_id, question_length_chars, page_url
- **Span 2:** `qabot.chat.query.complete`
  - Attributes: session_id, duration_ms, status (answered/deflected/error), citation_count
- **Span 3:** `qabot.chat.session.reset`
  - Attributes: session_id, reset_trigger (browser_close/explicit_button)
### Performance SLOs
- **Latency p95:** < 10,000ms
- **Availability:** 99.9%
- **Error Rate:** < 1%
### Alerting Conditions
- **Critical:** p95 latency exceeds 15,000ms for 5 consecutive minutes → Teams/PagerDuty
- **Warning:** Error rate exceeds 1% over 10-minute window → Teams notification
