## Dimension 5: Frontend & Accessibility
### EMIS-X Platform Mandates (Non-Negotiable)
- **WA-005:** pnpm only — `pnpm-lock.yaml` must exist; `package-lock.json` / `yarn.lock` forbidden
- **DS-001:** `@emisgroup/ui-*` components only — no native `<button>`, `<input>`, `<textarea>`, `<dialog>`
- **DS-002:** Design tokens only — no hardcoded hex/rgb/hsl in CSS/SCSS; use `var(--token-*)`
- **DS-004:** Iconify `~icons/ic/outline-*` — no lucide-react, react-icons, heroicons
- **WSEC-013:** `@emisgroup/acp-security-headers` in package.json dependencies
- **HTTP-002a:** `axios.create({ timeout: 30_000 })` — no raw `fetch()` or bare `axios.get()`
- **HTTP-003a:** No `httpAgent` / `httpsAgent` / `keepAlive` — browser SPA must not configure Node.js agents
- **WCS-007a:** All UI text via `t()` from react-i18next; keys in `src/locales/en-GB/translation.json`
- **WCS-007b:** British English spellings — colour, centre, grey, behaviour, licence
- **A11Y-010:** `jest-axe` + `toHaveNoViolations()` in every component test file
### Accessibility Requirements
- Chat input field must have `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby` (A11Y-004a)
- Loading/thinking state must use `aria-live="polite"` or `role="status"` (A11Y-007a)
- Error states must use `role="alert"` (A11Y-007a)
- Widget open/close toggle must be keyboard accessible
